\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {One lift, two policies} (test object 2, 72\,g, $\mu _s=0.77$, $r=1.2$; MuJoCo renders replayed from the recorded simulation states, with visual-only finger and palm geometry added). The red mark on the palm sits at the rod's initial top. The unshielded residual (top) grips 9\% below the model's grip for its lift time; the rod breaks away near peak acceleration and ends 21\,mm low. The shield-trained residual (bottom) lifts equally fast with a certified grip; the rod does not move relative to the fingers.}}{5}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
