\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Every failure of the worst unshielded seed} (B2 seed 2, $r=1.2$, 14 of 40 test objects): slip against time for the model controller (B0), the unshielded residual (B2) and the shield-trained residual (B5, seed 2) on the same object and episode seed. All 14 failures share the mechanism of Fig.~\ref {fig:anatomy}; final slips range from 9 to 25\,mm.}}{20}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
