\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Per-object test results.} $m$ and $\mu _s$ are the object's mass and static friction; $F_{\rm  stuck}/F_b$ is the probed breakaway grip relative to the true quasi-static breakaway grip $F_b=mg/(2\mu _s)$ (it is $\ge 1$ by construction and at most $1/0.9$ up to sensing noise); probes and probe time are from the B0 episode at $r=1$. Grip columns are $F/mg$ (mean over $r$ and seeds). B2 failures count lifts with slip $>5$\,mm over 5 seeds $\times $ 4 values of $r$.}}{21}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
